                                                "sense_id": "2f0bd75c-8585-3a34-99f1-eb44425bc217",
                                                "text": "All these miseries, however, are not without their remedy; when the sufferings of the natives are at their climax, the mercury will give the sure indication of a coming pampero, as the south-wester is called […]"
